error[SCXML070]: a `<send>` to `#_internal` cannot use `delay`
 --> tests/ui/scxml070-delayed-internal-send.scxml:4:46
  |
4 |       <send event="tick" target="#_internal" delay="1s"/>
  |                          ------------------- ^^^^^^^^^^ a delay is not allowed here
  |                          |
  |                          the send targets the internal event queue
  |
  = note: an event sent to `#_internal` joins the internal event queue at once; SCXML forbids a delay on it, and the processor raises `error.execution` instead of delivering the event
  = help: remove `delay` to raise the event now, or drop the `target` to deliver it after the delay on the session's own external queue
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>
help: remove `delay`
  |
